{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NjxcCH5qowwW9dx99DJG69","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I can provide you with the answer:\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\nThe final name of the enum type introduced in the DSL opt-in support proposal for header-aware state stores is **`DslStoreFormat`**.\\\\n\\\\nThis enum was introduced in **PR #21572** (KAFKA-20220), which was merged on 2026-02-27 to enable headers-aware key-value stores in the Kafka Streams DSL as part of **KIP-1285: DSL Opt-in Support for Header-Aware State Stores**.\\\\n\\\\n### Sources:\\\\n\\\\n1. **pull-requests.md** (line 211): \\\\\\\"Introduces **DslStoreFormat enum** and extends DslKeyValueParams to enable headers-aware key-value stores in Kafka Streams DSL, implementing foundational infrastructure for KIP-1285\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n2. **discussions.md** (line 240): PR #21572 [1/N] introduces **DslStoreFormat enum** and extends DslKeyValueParams\\\\n\\\\n3. **discussions.md** (line 514): \\\\\\\"Enables headers-aware key-value stores in Kafka Streams DSL through **DslStoreFormat enum** and DslKeyValueParams extension\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis enum was designed to replace the boolean `isTimestamped` and `isHeadersEnabled` parameters on Dsl*Params constructors, providing a more extensible type-safe option for DSL opt-in support for headers-aware state stores.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"pull-requests.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":29.37,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":222991,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":46415,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1278531,\\\"input_tokens\\\":74,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2530}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8672d8ac-a65c-4ec4-92a6-3511bcd4a826","uuid":"bc45fb47-2ac9-4c73-b162-7c17de7b07a5","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:53:31.348Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I can provide you with the answer:\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\nThe final name of the enum type introduced in the DSL opt-in support proposal for header-aware state stores is **`DslStoreFormat`**.\\\\n\\\\nThis enum was introduced in **PR #21572** (KAFKA-20220), which was merged on 2026-02-27 to enable headers-aware key-value stores in the Kafka Streams DSL as part of **KIP-1285: DSL Opt-in Support for Header-Aware State Stores**.\\\\n\\\\n### Sources:\\\\n\\\\n1. **pull-requests.md** (line 211): \\\\\\\"Introduces **DslStoreFormat enum** and extends DslKeyValueParams to enable headers-aware key-value stores in Kafka Streams DSL, implementing foundational infrastructure for KIP-1285\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n2. **discussions.md** (line 240): PR #21572 [1/N] introduces **DslStoreFormat enum** and extends DslKeyValueParams\\\\n\\\\n3. **discussions.md** (line 514): \\\\\\\"Enables headers-aware key-value stores in Kafka Streams DSL through **DslStoreFormat enum** and DslKeyValueParams extension\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThis enum was designed to replace the boolean `isTimestamped` and `isHeadersEnabled` parameters on Dsl*Params constructors, providing a more extensible type-safe option for DSL opt-in support for headers-aware state stores.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"index.md\\\",\\\"pull-requests.md\\\",\\\"discussions.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":29.37,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":222991,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":46415,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1278531,\\\"input_tokens\\\":74,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2530}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search of the context filesystem, I can provide you with the answer:\\n\\n## Answer\\n\\nThe final name of the enum type introduced in the DSL opt-in support proposal for header-aware state stores is **`DslStoreFormat`**.\\n\\nThis enum was introduced in **PR #21572** (KAFKA-20220), which was merged on 2026-02-27 to enable headers-aware key-value stores in the Kafka Streams DSL as part of **KIP-1285: DSL Opt-in Support for Header-Aware State Stores**.\\n\\n### Sources:\\n\\n1. **pull-requests.md** (line 211): \\\"Introduces **DslStoreFormat enum** and extends DslKeyValueParams to enable headers-aware key-value stores in Kafka Streams DSL, implementing foundational infrastructure for KIP-1285\\\"\\n\\n2. **discussions.md** (line 240): PR #21572 [1/N] introduces **DslStoreFormat enum** and extends DslKeyValueParams\\n\\n3. **discussions.md** (line 514): \\\"Enables headers-aware key-value stores in Kafka Streams DSL through **DslStoreFormat enum** and DslKeyValueParams extension\\\"\\n\\nThis enum was designed to replace the boolean `isTimestamped` and `isHeadersEnabled` parameters on Dsl*Params constructors, providing a more extensible type-safe option for DSL opt-in support for headers-aware state stores.\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"store\",\"index.md\",\"pull-requests.md\",\"discussions.md\"],\"seconds\":29.37,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":3,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":222991,\"cache_write_tokens\":46415,\"cost_usd\":0.1278531,\"input_tokens\":74,\"output_tokens\":2530}}"}}}
